Jakub et al,

Would it not be possible to create a partitioned bootable CD image
similar to SunOS/Solaris install CDs which could contain a bootable
partition for sun4c/m/u and a second partition for sun4?

I may be off-base here, but I believe that a sun4-specific kernel
could not be used on a sun4c/m/u, and this might just solve the
problem.  Having a unified install media is more interesting to
me than the SRPMS in this instance.

E
